    {
      "name": "places/ChIJLYRa2CNr1moRAWvnh1a8YT4/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvMF9lOWFREAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "This Hong Kong Supermarket was a very impressive one. Their standard prices were very competitive if compared with those Asian supermarkets in the Melbourne CBD.\n\nWhat made the difference included they generously offered significant discounts on a large number of popular items, therefore effectively helping you to save quite a lot of money if you are ok to buy multiple quantities / packs etc.\n\nI have visited most Asian supermarkets in the Melbourne CBD and some in the eastern suburbs. I reckon this one is the best one in terms of big variety of choices, reasonable prices and convenient location with many car park spaces.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "This Hong Kong Supermarket was a very impressive one. Their standard prices were very competitive if compared with those Asian supermarkets in the Melbourne CBD.\n\nWhat made the difference included they generously offered significant discounts on a large number of popular items, therefore effectively helping you to save quite a lot of money if you are ok to buy multiple quantities / packs etc.\n\nI have visited most Asian supermarkets in the Melbourne CBD and some in the eastern suburbs. I reckon this one is the best one in terms of big variety of choices, reasonable prices and convenient location with many car park spaces.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
